{
  "name": "gascity-mcp-comparison",
  "description": "codeprobe-9tk [44i-confirm]: with-sg-narrow SDLC confirm run at the 4cl6-recommended cap (UNCAPPED). Three arms (local-only / with-sg-narrow / with-sg-full) x 5 SDLC tasks x N=6, all uncapped (max_turns=null) with the STEP-0 raised wall-clock guard (extra.timeout_seconds=10800, commit d559f5e). Confirms the evjr.4 relative ordering (narrow >= local > full on reward; narrow cheapest of the SG arms) at the proper cap, removing evjr.4's two caveats (small N=3, contaminated cap=50). with-sg-narrow = with-sg-full + a disallowed_tools block on the sourcegraph read/browse MCP tools (read_file/list_files/list_repos/commit_search/diff_search/compare_revisions; unprefixed MCP ids verified from trace.db, commit 462b3a6). Budget revised to $500 (bead's $120 predates the uncapped-cost discovery; Stephanie approved N=6 at the revised ceiling).",
  "tasks_dir": "tasks",
  "configs": [
    {
      "label": "local-only",
      "agent": "claude",
      "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
      "permission_mode": "default",
      "mcp_config": null,
      "allowed_tools": null,
      "disallowed_tools": null,
      "mcp_mode": "strict",
      "instruction_variant": null,
      "preambles": [],
      "reward_type": "binary",
      "max_turns": null,
      "extra": {
        "timeout_seconds": 10800
      }
    },
    {
